abstract: >-
  Self-hosted single-backend AI agent platform. FastAPI + React 19, streaming chat, single + multi-agent teams, RAG, memory, code sandbox, 4 ready-made enterprise presets, 19 LLM providers, 30+ tools. One process, one command.
